    "http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#historyNote": [
      {
        "@value": "Group status: This group is reserved for soil/water chemistry testing associated with geotechnical design assessments. Environmental contamination testing should be recorded in Group ELRG\nAGS 4.1: Headings Added - SPEC_BASE, GCHM_DEV, GCHM_SGRP, GCHM_LSID, GCHM_RDEV, GCHM_RDAT, GCHM_DTIM, GCHM_TEST, GCHM_IREF, GCHM_ITYP\nAGS 4.1: Group Rule Added - • Where a reading has no unit, the GCHM_UNIT data shall be set to 'UNITLESS' • Units included in GCHM_UNIT shall be fully defined in the UNIT group (Rule 15), the unit group is case sensitive. • Data type for data field heading GCHM_UNIT shall not be changed from PU."
      }
    ],
